# robonix/skill/guided_tour/run — start the guided tour (导览).
# Visits each configured stop in order: navigate there with nav2, then speak
# the stop's announcement. Returns immediately with a run_id; poll run/status
# and abort with run/cancel. Empty `stop_names` runs every stop; otherwise it
# is a whitespace/comma-separated list of stop names to visit (a subset).
string stop_names
---
bool accepted
string run_id
string detail
